    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Burning and numbness of the fingers with cold; no weakness; no foot symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Positive</td><td>White, blue, then red fingers in the cold; no ulcers</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Long-standing stiffness of the right shoulder; no new joint pain</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood fair; sleep broken on cold nights by finger pain</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

